WEBVTT

00:00:00.115 --> 00:00:05.707
This video shows how to create a student's login while adding the student, on a phone.

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:11.676
Tap the menu button, open Management, and tap Students.

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:26.351
Tap Add Student. The form opens with the class, the student name and the parent details.

00:00:33.428 --> 00:00:41.444
Choose the class, then type the student name, the parent name and the parent phone. The roll number is filled in for you.

00:00:54.415 --> 00:01:01.783
Scroll down in the form and tap Create User Account. The username is suggested from the student's name.

00:01:07.477 --> 00:01:14.821
Type a password of at least eight characters, then type it again to confirm. The email is optional.

00:01:20.773 --> 00:01:29.869
Tap Add Student. A green message says the student and the user account were created, and the student can sign in to the Student Portal.

00:01:36.476 --> 00:01:40.820
Share the username and password with the student so they can sign in.
